#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""budicek: Buddy's wake-up service for delegated bot work.

Buddy never waits on a bot synchronously. `budicek zadej` records the
delegation, prepares a Hermes Kanban card with a `wake` subscription and starts
the bot in MausBot. `budicek hlidej` (a systemd user service) pulls the state of
every open delegation from MausBot and, on any outcome (done, failed, question,
missed deadline, MausBot down), completes the Kanban card. Hermes then wakes
Buddy in his main conversation. Buddy acknowledges with `budicek potvrd`;
without an acknowledgement the service wakes him again (at most twice) and then
messages the user directly.

All state lives on disk, one JSON file per delegation, written atomically, so
the service survives its own restart. Standard library only.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

